# Quest drops (mod-quest-drops), ChromieCraft's realm: a quest drop rolls 75% where its chance was under
# 75%, 50% where it was 10% or less, its own chance from 75% up; an epic or better in a dungeon or from a
# rare spawn ten times its chance, 10% at least and 100% at most; any other drop its own chance (the
# user's rules). What the module rolls for each:
cmd .questdrops chance 40
expect Quest drops: 40 rolls 75 for a quest item, 100 for an epic in a dungeon or from a rare, 40 for any other
cmd .questdrops chance 35
expect Quest drops: 35 rolls 75 for a quest item, 100 for an epic in a dungeon or from a rare, 35 for any other
cmd .questdrops chance 74
expect Quest drops: 74 rolls 75 for a quest item, 100 for an epic in a dungeon or from a rare, 74 for any other
cmd .questdrops chance 80
expect Quest drops: 80 rolls 80 for a quest item, 100 for an epic in a dungeon or from a rare, 80 for any other
cmd .questdrops chance 15
expect Quest drops: 15 rolls 75 for a quest item, 100 for an epic in a dungeon or from a rare, 15 for any other
cmd .questdrops chance 10
expect Quest drops: 10 rolls 50 for a quest item, 100 for an epic in a dungeon or from a rare, 10 for any other
cmd .questdrops chance 5
expect Quest drops: 5 rolls 50 for a quest item, 50 for an epic in a dungeon or from a rare, 5 for any other
cmd .questdrops chance 0.5
expect Quest drops: 0.5 rolls 50 for a quest item, 10 for an epic in a dungeon or from a rare, 0.5 for any other
cmd .questdrops chance 100
expect Quest drops: 100 rolls 100 for a quest item, 100 for an epic in a dungeon or from a rare, 100 for any other
# And in the loot: Piercing the Veil (1470, a warlock's) asks for Rattlecage Skeletons' Rattlecage
# Skulls, which they drop at 15%. Now 75%: twenty kills, nine skulls at least (a working module misses
# that about once in a thousand tries; at 15% it's reached about once in a thousand). The character
# stands beside each skeleton before it falls (one called over from afar can die out of looting reach,
# where the core lets go of its corpse without a loot window).
cmd .levelup 9
cmd .quest add 1470
go 0 1974.2 1499.7 86.5
cmd .questdrops near 1890
kill-loot 1890
cmd .questdrops near 1890
kill-loot 1890
cmd .questdrops near 1890
kill-loot 1890
cmd .questdrops near 1890
kill-loot 1890
cmd .questdrops near 1890
kill-loot 1890
